# Golden-image references are COMMITTED — everything here is tracked except the
# diagnostics a failing run drops next to them:
#
#   <name>.actual.png   the frame that was captured instead of the golden
#   <name>.diff.png     magenta where the two exceed the tolerance
#
# Both are regenerated on every failure and must never be committed (a stale
# .actual.png next to a passing golden is pure confusion). See tests/render/
# GoldenImage.cpp and plan doc 28 §9.5.
*.actual.png
*.diff.png
